### Doctor schedule — paginated filter (doctor only)
### Run api/auth/login.http first — the jwt variable is captured automatically.
GET http://localhost:8030/consultation/schedule?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-31",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

###

### Same endpoint — no filters (returns all slots)
GET http://localhost:8030/consultation/schedule?page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

{}

###
